      "description": "<p></strong></p><p>Roll randomly for the right or left eye. Even through closed lids all you can see is an empty whiteness. Your eye is <strong>nonfunctional</strong>, and if not treated within 24 hours your vision will be permanently <strong>missing</strong>.</p><p><em>Treatment</em> - A DC 20 Save Sense Surgery.</p>",
